      "writtenOn": "2018-08-23T17:26:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "looks like PCRRead implementation doesn\u0027t rely on this fact (FilterPCr does the job for all sizes), but technically sizeofSelect should be \u003e\u003d PCR_SELECT_MIN (\u003d3). We send 2 here. To avoid incompatibilities if we change the underlying TPM2 stack, let\u0027s fill with zerioes up to PCR_SELECT_MIN and set sizeofSelect to it.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 31,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 31,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "3179b533c5bd2014602e41e75037cc5cd2080412",
