      "writtenOn": "2018-08-23T17:26:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "shouldn\u0027t bitmask be uint8_t bitmask[2] instead to avoid converting back and forth between byte order in pcrSelect[] and byte order in wherever this bitmask comes from? then it can be just memcpy() here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 32,
        "startChar": 1,
