      "writtenOn": "2018-08-23T17:26:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PCRRead may return an updated bitmask with unimplemented PCRs excluded from it, so there may be less values if that happens. we may want to check, and probably error out if a requested PCR is actually not implemented.",
